{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわかつきっ(｀_´)ゞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼ふわっとして女の子っぽくしてみた!!／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/6586850/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうも、中田が『サラダうどんが食べたい。けど今日どこ解散カナ』との問いかけに『今日は会社解散だね』と言いたかったのに『今日は会社うどんだね』ととてつもない勢いでうどん言った若月です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てぃやーい！目がシャキーン!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とテンション高まって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"始まりました若月ブログ!!!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メガシャキの記者会見でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この日はなんだか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ふわっとしてみたかったから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写メの時、花柄ワンピースに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白鍵編みカーディガンでした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/19/6586850/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ、出だしに触れましたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よくありますよね..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何か言おうと思っている時に"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"別のことを考えてたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聞いたりすると一緒になってしまうこと。うん、あるある。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『やったぁ』と『よかった』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が一緒になって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大きな声で『よったぁあああ』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と叫んだことある。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、『寄ったぁあああ』って何がだよ。何が何に何でだよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と自分に突っ込んでしまった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんて誰にも言えやしない。ぇ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『やったぁ』と『わーい』が一緒になって『やーい！』と言ったこともある。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャイアンなのかと一瞬疑った、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんもこんな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体験ありますよね?(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(あると言って(  ；∀；))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、というわけでね若月のくだらないミスのお話でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今から暑くて汗をかいたので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"半身浴です。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でわ、ばかつきぃ♪(/ω＼*)"}],"source":"archive"}